# Bot1 takes Bot2's Memnite with Control Magic and enchants it with Takklemaggot. At Bot1's upkeep - the upkeep of
# enchanted creature's controller - the -0/-1 counter kills it. "That creature's controller" is its controller as it last
# existed (CR 608.2h), Bot1, not its owner Bot2: Bot1 chooses, and must choose Bot2's Ornithopter, the one creature
# Takklemaggot could enchant (the ruling). Takklemaggot returns attached to it under Bot1's control.
[Bot1 Deck]
Control Magic
Takklemaggot
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Island
Island
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Control Magic.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Takklemaggot.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Takklemaggot.AttachedTo = Memnite
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
? Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Takklemaggot.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Plus0Minus1 = (absent)
